              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, shield and bow. May take light armour (+2 pts). Open Order. May be taken in Mixed Order with Kontaritoi, but then lose Open Order status. (Vlad the Impaler p.88)</characteristic>
