              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, handgun, and light armour (+1 pt). May take pavises (+1 pt). Handguns. Open Order. Allies and Mercenaries. Can be Permanent Mercenaries (+1 pt). (Vlad the Impaler p.89)</characteristic>
